38
00:02:35,250 --> 00:02:40,430
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">{With the Name of Hoshi</font>

39
00:03:10,580 --> 00:03:11,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shizune!</font>

40
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:13,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is anything wrong?!</font>

41
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:28,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it...?</font>

42
00:03:29,100 --> 00:03:31,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a protection commission
from the Village Hidden in the Stars.</font>

43
00:03:33,150 --> 00:03:34,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is there some kind
of problem with that?</font>

44
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've never heard about it, Shizune?</font>

45
00:03:37,780 --> 00:03:40,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Village Hidden in the Stars
is small in terms of scale,</font>

46
00:03:40,740 --> 00:03:44,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but they are very proud and
have often caused trouble...</font>

47
00:03:44,910 --> 00:03:46,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, will you accept?</font>

48
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:50,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't simply disregard it.</font>

49
00:03:50,330 --> 00:03:51,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

50
00:03:52,290 --> 00:03:55,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since you-know-what
is in that village.</font>

51
00:04:08,470 --> 00:04:11,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And it seems they'll form
a three-man team</font>

52
00:04:11,270 --> 00:04:12,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with Neji as the squad leader.</font>

53
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:17,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the Village Hidden in the Stars
is a Shinobi village, isn't it?</font>

54
00:04:18,940 --> 00:04:20,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then they should do
their own protecting</font>

55
00:04:21,070 --> 00:04:22,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without asking others.</font>

56
00:04:23,950 --> 00:04:26,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are often instances
of a small village</font>

57
00:04:26,450 --> 00:04:29,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with friendly relations
seeking cooperation.</font>

58
00:04:29,990 --> 00:04:32,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In particular, that village is small</font>

59
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:34,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and it seems there aren't
that many Shinobi.</font>

60
00:04:35,500 --> 00:04:39,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No kidding. But why's a place
like that being targeted?</font>

61
00:04:41,630 --> 00:04:42,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually...!</font>

62
00:04:43,550 --> 00:04:45,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It all happened 200 years ago.</font>

63
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:55,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A star fell in the village!</font>

64
00:04:57,690 --> 00:05:00,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those stars like in the sky,
not ninja stars or something?!</font>

65
00:05:01,070 --> 00:05:04,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right! It seems
there's a mysterious power in the star</font>

66
00:05:04,280 --> 00:05:05,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that has an effect on chakra!</font>

67
00:05:08,830 --> 00:05:10,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a superstition!</font>

68
00:05:10,700 --> 00:05:14,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the first place, no way has
a star ever come falling down!</font>

69
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:16,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's true!</font>

70
00:05:16,420 --> 00:05:18,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's actually been targeted
several times until now</font>

71
00:05:18,670 --> 00:05:20,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by Shinobi of other lands.</font>

72
00:05:21,550 --> 00:05:23,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By Shinobi of other lands?</font>

73
00:05:24,630 --> 00:05:26,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mysterious power, huh?</font>

74
00:05:27,130 --> 00:05:30,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Indeed, it does seem that someone
like Orochimaru would target it...</font>

75
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:34,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, I guess I'll be participating
in this one too!</font>

76
00:05:34,350 --> 00:05:37,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! But the three-man team's
already been determined.</font>

77
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got an ace up my sleeve...</font>

78
00:05:40,860 --> 00:05:44,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}{AMAGURIAMA SWEET SHOP</b></font>

79
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:52,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen up. I'll take the lead from here.</font>

80
00:05:53,290 --> 00:05:55,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's danger before
entering the village.</font>

81
00:05:55,330 --> 00:05:56,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, got it!</font>

82
00:05:56,870 --> 00:05:58,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hi, guys!</font>

83
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:01,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll go on ahead and be waiting!</font>

84
00:06:01,340 --> 00:06:02,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Hold it!</font>

85
00:06:03,050 --> 00:06:04,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That idiot!</font>

86
00:06:04,420 --> 00:06:07,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's Naruto doing
in a place like this?</font>

87
00:06:07,630 --> 00:06:08,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like I know.</font>

88
00:06:09,300 --> 00:06:10,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama, there was a report</font>

89
00:06:10,970 --> 00:06:13,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that Naruto has joined up
with Neji's squad.</font>

90
00:06:13,220 --> 00:06:15,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. I added him to
the Village Hidden in the Stars mission.</font>

91
00:06:16,100 --> 00:06:16,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...?!</font>

92
00:06:16,930 --> 00:06:20,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those four proved themselves
in the Katabami Gold Mine...</font>

93
00:06:20,190 --> 00:06:21,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and things will quiet down
in the village here, too.</font>

94
00:06:22,230 --> 00:06:25,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'd change an already determined
three-man squad just for that reason?!</font>

95
00:06:27,030 --> 00:06:27,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama?!</font>

96
00:06:31,950 --> 00:06:35,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rare Roasted Chestnut Bean Jelly
with gold leaf candy from Amaguriama?</font>

97
00:06:36,700 --> 00:06:39,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be that was from Naruto...?</font>

98
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tea! Hurry!</font>

99
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:43,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Mizura!
— You okay?!</font>

100
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:45,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm fine...</font>

101
00:07:46,610 --> 00:07:48,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you not to push yourself!</font>

102
00:07:48,900 --> 00:07:52,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I don't want to fall behind
everyone's training...</font>

103
00:07:54,990 --> 00:07:56,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing
during your training?!</font>

104
00:07:57,080 --> 00:07:59,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizura suddenly keeled
over in pain...</font>

105
00:07:59,540 --> 00:08:00,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take him to the medical treatment room.</font>

106
00:08:00,960 --> 00:08:01,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes sir.</font>

107
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:02,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll go, too.</font>

108
00:08:03,540 --> 00:08:05,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokuto by herself is
enough for an escort.</font>

109
00:08:07,090 --> 00:08:09,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru, you have a mission.</font>

110
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:18,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! I'm here first!</font>

111
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:22,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once I cross this valley,
I'll be in the Land of Bears.</font>

112
00:08:22,810 --> 00:08:24,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Village Hidden in the Stars
is close.</font>

113
00:08:31,110 --> 00:08:31,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!</font>

114
00:08:57,800 --> 00:08:58,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You little...!</font>

115
00:08:59,310 --> 00:09:00,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Kujaku...</font>

116
00:09:02,060 --> 00:09:02,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Protection!</font>

117
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:06,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy blocked Kunai knives
with chakra!</font>

118
00:09:06,940 --> 00:09:08,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

119
00:09:12,070 --> 00:09:12,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cut!</font>

120
00:09:16,740 --> 00:09:17,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

121
00:09:22,910 --> 00:09:24,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Incredible chakra!</font>

122
00:09:40,050 --> 00:09:40,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

123
00:09:41,140 --> 00:09:43,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy's an enemy...
He suddenly attacked!</font>

124
00:09:48,940 --> 00:09:50,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're Leaf Shinobi, right?</font>

125
00:09:54,530 --> 00:09:56,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you from
the Village Hidden in the Stars?</font>

126
00:09:57,660 --> 00:10:00,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Sumaru.
I came to pick you guys up.</font>

127
00:10:00,870 --> 00:10:02,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then why did you do such a thing...?</font>

128
00:10:03,540 --> 00:10:04,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look at that.</font>

129
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:33,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The border of the Land of Bears
is constantly filled with poison gas.</font>

130
00:10:34,070 --> 00:10:35,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's also serves as
a natural fortress</font>

131
00:10:35,730 --> 00:10:37,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">against invasion from other lands.</font>

132
00:10:37,860 --> 00:10:40,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this is the danger
you were talking about, huh?</font>

133
00:10:41,280 --> 00:10:45,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't that great, Naruto?
You owe Sumaru your life!</font>

134
00:10:45,830 --> 00:10:47,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the beginning of
a beautiful friendship</font>

135
00:10:47,910 --> 00:10:49,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">between the Leaf
and the Hidden Star Village.</font>

136
00:10:51,500 --> 00:10:53,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give me a break.</font>

137
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was it none of my concern?</font>

138
00:10:56,340 --> 00:10:58,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I could have just watched
and not done anything...</font>

139
00:11:15,730 --> 00:11:20,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}{"STARS"</b></font>

140
00:11:24,410 --> 00:11:25,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am Akahoshi</font>

141
00:11:25,990 --> 00:11:28,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I serve as the deputy Hoshikage
of the Village Hidden in the Stars.</font>

142
00:11:28,660 --> 00:11:30,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Deputy... Hoshikage?</font>

143
00:11:31,750 --> 00:11:35,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Due to the sudden passing
of the Third Hoshikage one year ago,</font>

144
00:11:35,210 --> 00:11:37,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">presently there is
no Hoshikage in this village...</font>

145
00:11:38,260 --> 00:11:40,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, I heard the only ones who can
refer to themselves as a Kage</font>

146
00:11:40,970 --> 00:11:42,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">are the leaders of
the Five Great Hidden Villages...</font>

147
00:11:44,260 --> 00:11:45,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That doesn't make any difference!</font>

148
00:11:46,350 --> 00:11:49,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We are not inferior to you guys!</font>

149
00:11:50,560 --> 00:11:53,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if we're small now,
this village will someday rival</font>

150
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:55,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Hidden Villages of
the Five Great Nations!</font>

151
00:11:55,900 --> 00:11:58,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At that time,
I'll become the true Hoshikage!</font>

152
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Silence!</font>

153
00:12:04,110 --> 00:12:05,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go back to the training ground.</font>

154
00:12:10,330 --> 00:12:12,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, wait up!</font>

155
00:12:12,410 --> 00:12:13,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Naruto!</font>

156
00:12:13,750 --> 00:12:14,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

157
00:12:16,040 --> 00:12:17,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now of all times!</font>

158
00:12:19,260 --> 00:12:21,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry about him.
Please continue your story.</font>

159
00:12:24,390 --> 00:12:25,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Forgive me.</font>

160
00:12:26,010 --> 00:12:28,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you say, the Shinobi in our village
are not qualified</font>

161
00:12:29,010 --> 00:12:30,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to refer to themselves as a Kage.</font>

162
00:12:31,930 --> 00:12:34,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, in this village,
there is the star</font>

163
00:12:35,060 --> 00:12:37,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that all the Kage in the Five
Great Hidden Villages also envy.</font>

164
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:39,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We will use the power
of the star and someday,</font>

165
00:12:39,530 --> 00:12:42,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this can become a village which can
claim the Sixth Kage title.</font>

166
00:12:43,450 --> 00:12:45,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that star is being targeted, right?</font>

167
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:50,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. Our search team
obtained some information.</font>

168
00:12:53,910 --> 00:12:55,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where did that guy go?</font>

169
00:13:11,850 --> 00:13:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

170
00:13:14,980 --> 00:13:18,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I finally caught up.
Was your name Omaru?</font>

171
00:13:18,900 --> 00:13:20,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not Omaru, Sumaru.</font>

172
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:23,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, sorry, sorry.</font>

173
00:13:23,690 --> 00:13:26,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Sumaru's sure
an interesting name.</font>

174
00:13:26,490 --> 00:13:29,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's another name for
the star cluster Pleiades or Spring Star.</font>

175
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:34,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone in this village has
a name associated with stars.</font>

176
00:13:34,910 --> 00:13:36,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all, this is a village
where a star fell.</font>

177
00:13:36,830 --> 00:13:38,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

178
00:13:40,210 --> 00:13:41,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you trying to elicit from me?</font>

179
00:13:42,300 --> 00:13:44,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Nothing in particular.</font>

180
00:13:45,220 --> 00:13:48,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hadn't thanked you for earlier, so.</font>

181
00:13:48,300 --> 00:13:50,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can tell even if you give me
the runaround...</font>

182
00:13:50,350 --> 00:13:53,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The people from other lands
are all after the star.</font>

183
00:13:54,890 --> 00:13:56,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you have that power,</font>

184
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:58,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you can stand above all
of the Hidden Villages, so...</font>

185
00:13:58,940 --> 00:14:02,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is your awesome chakra
also the power of the star?</font>

186
00:14:04,940 --> 00:14:06,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If they had that star,</font>

187
00:14:06,740 --> 00:14:08,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">would everyone have
the same chakra as you?</font>

188
00:14:08,950 --> 00:14:12,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! The more tremendous the power,</font>

189
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:13,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the more hard work is required
to control it!</font>

190
00:14:14,540 --> 00:14:16,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll work hard, work hard, work hard!</font>

191
00:14:17,210 --> 00:14:19,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll become the Hoshikage!</font>

192
00:14:19,580 --> 00:14:21,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! I look forward to working
with you at that time!</font>

193
00:14:23,050 --> 00:14:25,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm also going to become
the Hokage someday!</font>

194
00:14:27,420 --> 00:14:29,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a strange guy.</font>

195
00:14:29,970 --> 00:14:30,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really?</font>

196
00:15:32,070 --> 00:15:32,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Intruder!</font>

197
00:15:33,660 --> 00:15:34,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Protect the star!</font>

198
00:15:40,500 --> 00:15:44,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But they really are collapsed entirely
from the center towards the outside.</font>

199
00:15:44,790 --> 00:15:48,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When a star explodes in mid-air,
it seems they collapse like this.</font>

200
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:52,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the training area
where the star is enshrined.</font>

201
00:15:55,350 --> 00:15:57,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and show me the star.</font>

202
00:15:57,470 --> 00:16:01,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No. People from other lands
aren't allowed beyond this spot.</font>

203
00:16:01,850 --> 00:16:03,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the star is over there, right?</font>

204
00:16:04,190 --> 00:16:07,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't protect it
if I can't get close to it!</font>

205
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:10,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not like we trust you guys.</font>

206
00:16:11,490 --> 00:16:13,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, you're such a suspicious guy!</font>

207
00:16:14,160 --> 00:16:17,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why can't you trust us
who came here on a mission?!</font>

208
00:16:18,580 --> 00:16:19,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is my personality, you see.</font>

209
00:16:26,130 --> 00:16:27,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be?! No way.</font>

210
00:16:28,340 --> 00:16:29,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll chase him down!</font>

211
00:16:29,590 --> 00:16:32,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You go to your friends
in the training area.</font>

212
00:16:33,680 --> 00:16:35,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry!</font>

213
00:16:36,640 --> 00:16:38,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right. Okay.</font>

214
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:49,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokuto!</font>

215
00:16:59,410 --> 00:17:01,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru... I'm sorry.</font>

216
00:17:01,910 --> 00:17:03,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We couldn't protect the star...</font>

217
00:17:09,840 --> 00:17:10,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You little!</font>

218
00:17:15,930 --> 00:17:18,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's ridiculous to do something
like steal in someone else's village</font>

219
00:17:18,300 --> 00:17:20,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in broad daylight, you little thief!</font>

220
00:17:24,180 --> 00:17:26,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Multiple Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

221
00:17:31,690 --> 00:17:33,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, I won't let you get away!</font>

222
00:17:38,160 --> 00:17:40,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Kujaku...</font>

223
00:17:47,120 --> 00:17:48,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This chakra?!</font>

224
00:17:49,420 --> 00:17:50,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Beast!</font>

225
00:17:59,340 --> 00:18:00,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Move away!</font>

226
00:18:04,020 --> 00:18:07,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire the Everywhere Shuriken Jutsu
towards that monster!</font>

227
00:18:16,950 --> 00:18:17,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's futile!</font>

228
00:18:21,780 --> 00:18:23,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is my real target!</font>

229
00:18:23,870 --> 00:18:25,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I found your weak point.</font>

230
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:29,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The main body doesn't move
while controlling the chakra!</font>

231
00:18:30,040 --> 00:18:32,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go! Clone Body Slam!</font>

232
00:18:37,840 --> 00:18:40,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are more ways to
use my chakra!</font>

233
00:19:01,240 --> 00:19:03,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That one hit hard.</font>

234
00:19:09,540 --> 00:19:10,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Synthesis!</font>

235
00:19:18,130 --> 00:19:19,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn...</font>

236
00:19:22,840 --> 00:19:23,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

237
00:19:34,480 --> 00:19:35,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wings!</font>

238
00:19:53,750 --> 00:19:55,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can fly?!</font>

239
00:20:09,640 --> 00:20:10,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You let him get away.</font>

240
00:20:10,390 --> 00:20:12,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry. But...</font>

241
00:20:12,520 --> 00:20:14,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was my mistake for
leaving it to you.</font>

242
00:20:16,400 --> 00:20:20,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But as for him,
he used the same ninja art as you.</font>

243
00:20:23,910 --> 00:20:25,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the meaning of this?!</font>

244
00:20:28,870 --> 00:20:31,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only those who perform
the star training</font>

245
00:20:31,910 --> 00:20:32,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">can use that ninja art...</font>

246
00:20:33,210 --> 00:20:35,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then you're saying
he's someone from this village?</font>

247
00:20:37,960 --> 00:20:38,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know...</font>

248
00:20:49,640 --> 00:20:52,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the one who let him get away.</font>

249
00:20:53,310 --> 00:20:56,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll get the star back, no matter what!</font>

250
00:21:19,420 --> 00:21:22,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>kaze ga fuite aa</b></font></font></font>

251
00:21:19,420 --> 00:21:22,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>the wind blows</b></font></font></font>

252
00:21:22,800 --> 00:21:26,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>itai kienai omoi</b></font></font></font>

253
00:21:22,800 --> 00:21:26,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>the pain, the memories won't disappear</b></font></font></font>

254
00:21:26,300 --> 00:21:29,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>nani wo motte ikou ka</b></font></font></font>

255
00:21:26,300 --> 00:21:29,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>what should be brought along?</b></font></font></font>

256
00:21:29,300 --> 00:21:33,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>atsumete hitotsu</b></font></font></font>

257
00:21:29,300 --> 00:21:33,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>assemble them into a piece</b></font></font></font>

258
00:21:32,640 --> 00:21:35,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>nido to nai nido to nai</b></font></font></font>

259
00:21:32,640 --> 00:21:35,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>there is no second chance, never</b></font></font></font>

260
00:21:35,870 --> 00:21:39,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>suteru nante baka mitai</b></font></font></font>

261
00:21:35,870 --> 00:21:39,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>how foolish it is to throw away</b></font></font></font>

262
00:21:39,080 --> 00:21:42,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>mujaki ni natte aa</b></font></font></font>

263
00:21:39,080 --> 00:21:42,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>acting so innocently</b></font></font></font>

264
00:21:42,110 --> 00:21:43,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>imeeji</b></font></font></font>

265
00:21:42,110 --> 00:21:43,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>the images</b></font></font></font>

266
00:21:45,820 --> 00:21:50,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>kitto sore wa owaranai</b></font></font></font>

267
00:21:45,820 --> 00:21:50,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>it probably will not end</b></font></font></font>

268
00:21:52,660 --> 00:21:57,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>kitto sore wa owaranai</b></font></font></font>

269
00:21:52,660 --> 00:21:57,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>it probably will not end</b></font></font></font>

270
00:21:58,700 --> 00:22:01,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>ai no mune kogase</b></font></font></font>

271
00:21:58,700 --> 00:22:01,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>burn that love-filled heart</b></font></font></font>

272
00:22:01,600 --> 00:22:04,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>sen no yume watare</b></font></font></font>

273
00:22:01,600 --> 00:22:04,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>sail across a thousand dreams</b></font></font></font>

274
00:22:04,900 --> 00:22:07,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>juuoumujin kakete</b></font></font></font>

275
00:22:04,900 --> 00:22:07,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>running freely</b></font></font></font>

276
00:22:07,710 --> 00:22:11,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>te ni tsukamu sekai</b></font></font></font>

277
00:22:07,710 --> 00:22:11,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>to take hold of the world in hand</b></font></font></font>

278
00:22:11,610 --> 00:22:14,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>kumo ga chigirete</b></font></font></font>

279
00:22:11,610 --> 00:22:14,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>the clouds scatter</b></font></font></font>

280
00:22:14,710 --> 00:22:17,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>hi ga mata ochite</b></font></font></font>

281
00:22:14,710 --> 00:22:17,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>the sun sets yet again</b></font></font></font>

282
00:22:17,720 --> 00:22:24,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>hitori no pareedo ga ugokidasu</b></font></font></font>

283
00:22:17,720 --> 00:22:24,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>the solo parade begins to move</b></font></font></font>

